WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:10.760
Admin guide, part one. Admins work from the same volunteer page as everyone else. Here's how to get into the admin view, and what's on its home screen.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:18.651
Open your own volunteer page. If you're an admin, you see two extra buttons at the top: Admin, and Directory.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:20.610
Tap Admin.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:31.317
The first time on a device, sign in with Google. Use the Google account that's on the Portal admins list. A volunteer code alone never opens admin.

00:00:31.517 --> 00:00:35.450
Your admin sign-in lasts twelve hours on that device.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:42.210
The brown bar means you're in admin view. Everything you look up or change is logged, with your name.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:50.304
My dashboard goes back to your own page. Search brings you back to this home screen. Directory opens the volunteer directory.

00:00:50.504 --> 00:01:00.382
Exit admin leaves admin view, but keeps you signed in. Sign out ends your admin sign-in on this device. Always sign out on a shared phone or computer.

00:01:00.582 --> 00:01:05.010
The home screen starts with Look up a volunteer. That's part two.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:11.258
Next, stands from the last three days, each with a Time sheet button. That's part four.

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:20.483
Hub games are the games that use the Hub's own sign-up. Their rosters let you add, move, hand off, and remove people. Parts five and six.

00:01:20.683 --> 00:01:27.580
SignUp.com games show who's working, read only, with group text buttons. Parts seven and eight.
